ate with the  authorities to help figure out what  really happened but there is no way they  were stepping foot back in the country  months before the hack the brothers got  citizenship on the island of vanuatu a  little island with no taxes and  visa-free access to over 130 countries  and since then they've been traced to  tanzania dubai and london but their  current location is still a mystery  this is how two brothers became  billionaires in just two years by  pulling off the biggest crypto heist in  history  [Music]  so  [Music]  reyes and amir khajii weren't new to  crypto when they started afrocrypt in  2019. reyes had apparently got into  mining bitcoin when he was just 13 years  old while still in school he had made a  trading algorithm to let him and his  brother make money while attending  classes real child genius stuff or at  least that's what they claim  according to the brothers their  algorithm has such great returns that  reyes was even flown to china by huby  one of china's crypto platforms  they came from a well-off family so they  didn't look like desperate poor kids  looking for easy money  with such a great backstory it's no  surprise people were pumped to hear that  the brothers were starting an investment  company that they could get in on africa  promised incredible returns and on the  surface it worked for almost two years  every month africa's investors would get  statements on their accounts showing  their balances shooting up and as word  spread about afrocrypt success more and  more people wanted to get in on the  profits but to become a client every new  investor had to sign an agreement  what the brother snuck into that  agreement was a clause that released  africa from any liability specifically  in the case of hacking  [Music]  and as we all know no one reads the  terms of service no one does due  diligence no one wants to know how these  returns were possible all they needed to  hear was that they were going to be  guaranteed money 